  how: "In the deployment profile: 'Apply device name template' (Entra join). Max 15 characters, letters/numbers/hyphens, can't be only numbers, no spaces.",
  gotcha: "Spaces are not allowed; hybrid-join naming instead comes from the domain join configuration profile. Renaming after deployment requires the Rename device remote action.",
  exam: "Spot the invalid template (spaces, >15 chars, all digits).",
