  what: "<b>Teams Rooms on Android</b> & panels enroll via AOSP/dedicated profiles; <b>HoloLens 2</b> runs Windows Holographic (Autopilot self-deploying, kiosk mode); <b>Zebra</b> ruggeds use OEMConfig (Zebra OEMConfig app) or legacy StageNow.",
